{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/t09.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/t09.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "t09_01",
      "hash64": "809C074CFB302532",
      "text": "欢迎来到焙固镇。\\n这里是星星与陶瓷器的城镇。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "t09_02",
      "hash64": "809C064CFB30237F",
      "text": "我家代代都是陶器工匠！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "t09_03",
      "hash64": "809C054CFB3021CC",
      "text": "水流好小……\\c\\n要是能像水炮一样喷出来，\\n那该多好玩呀。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "t09_05",
      "hash64": "809C034CFB301E66",
      "text": "好大的盘子！\\n这是几人份的三明治呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "t09_06",
      "hash64": "809C024CFB301CB3",
      "text": "焙固的餐具在帕底亚\\n也是很受欢迎的工艺品哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "t09_07",
      "hash64": "809C014CFB301B00",
      "text": "陶器是从窑炉中诞生出来的。\\c\\n把成形的粘土放进窑炉中，\\n再花上好几天慢慢煅烧而成。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "t09_19",
      "hash64": "80990B4CFB2DF627",
      "text": "这个镇子的对战场\\n过去是作为天文台建造而成的哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "t09_23",
      "hash64": "80A3154CFB365BAA",
      "text": "爬上前面那条坡道后，\\n有看起来像茶一样的宝可梦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "t09_24",
      "hash64": "80A3104CFB36532B",
      "text": "到焙固镇的这一路\\n是不是把你折腾坏了呀？\\c\\n不过只要来过１次，\\n下次就能搭飞翔出租车来了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "t09_30",
      "hash64": "809F8E4CFB33406E",
      "text": "焙固镇的交通很不方便！\\n摩托蜥是不可或缺的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "t09_40",
      "hash64": "808E904CFB24D0A1",
      "text": "我是为了道馆馆主莉普而来的。\\n但这里的盘子也好可爱啊～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "t09_43",
      "hash64": "808E8D4CFB24CB88",
      "text": "天文台的宝可梦的画\\n又简单又可爱吧？\\r\\n那个叫点阵图，没错吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
